{"ok": true, "messages": [{"ts": "1759274400.792657", "type": "message", "text": "checked the fixes since the sep 22 gate on #135 / #50: ZOM-503 giving lives ok, ZOM-506 zombie lane text ok, ZOM-557 consecutive login ok, ZOM-561 low-end black surfaces ok, ZOM-434 no flying items after backgrounding during load, ZOM-558 weekly board says Level: now. rest tomorrow", "channel": "C08R27X0EAH", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759248458.722989", "type": "message", "text": "Oh, I can see so many possibilities of cancer levels with those pigs and mixing mugs with the frizbees :[USERNAME_21162]:", "channel": "C08R8CHB0QL", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "thread_ts": "1759248458.722989"}, {"ts": "1759210834.849979", "type": "message", "text": "I just checked some folks that left level 6 but didn't start level 7, and you get these strange behavior that i'm 100% sure it's just bot.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID", "thread_ts": "1759207989.371869"}, {"ts": "1759210612.509939", "type": "message", "text": "so for all the people that didn't leave level 6, at least 11 are bots", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID", "thread_ts": "1759207989.371869"}, {"ts": "1759210589.579679", "type": "message", "text": "I had to spot check just to see if bots go deeper into the funnel, so I extended this to level 6, so begin 1 but did not left 6. It increases the count by 3, and I checked all 3 logs, all bots...", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID", "thread_ts": "1759207989.371869"}, {"ts": "1759210228.486879", "type": "message", "text": "Out of 28 that I observed that started level 1, but did not have a left level 5 event (basically all those who didn't make it past level 5)

AT LEAST EIGHT are bots. These are the ones that I'm 99% sure. There are still a lot of heavily questionable ones but I wanted to be lenient and not just blame bots.

For example if a user loads the app, loads level 1, did not click on a single item, quits. I did not consider this a bot.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID", "thread_ts": "1759207989.371869"}], "has_more": false, "total_count": 6, "response_metadata": {"next_cursor": ""}}

